+## [0.8.0] — Unreleased
+
+### Added
+- `configlayer.loader.YAMLLoader` — minimal-YAML-subset loader: block mappings
+  and block sequences nested by indentation, one-line flow collections, quoted
+  and bare scalars with `true`/`false`/`null` coercion, and comments.  Anchors,
+  aliases, tags, block scalars, multi-document streams and multi-line flow
+  collections are rejected with a `LoaderError` naming the construct.
+- `FileSource` gains a `yaml` format, auto-detected for `.yaml`/`.yml` files;
+  parse failures surface as `SourceError` with the loader error chained.
+
 ## [0.7.0] — 2026-07-20
 
